# Architecture

- Use standalone components and strict TypeScript.
- Put feature UI and services in `src/app/features/<name>/`.
- Keep components focused on presentation and orchestration.
- Use typed injectable services for HTTP and persistence.
- Prefer signals for local synchronous state and RxJS for async streams.
- Keep tests beside the components and services they cover.
